{
  "category": "Flowering Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Even veteran Trainers face a challenge in getting its beautiful flower to bloom. This Pokémon is popular with celebrities.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect. It withers if a Trainer does not take good care of it.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect, but taking care of it is very difficult.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect, but taking care of it is very difficult.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect. It withers if a Trainer does not take good care of it.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even veteran Trainers face a challenge in getting its beautiful flower to bloom. This Pokémon is popular with celebrities.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect. It withers if a Trainer does not take good care of it.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even veteran Trainers face a challenge in getting its beautiful flower to bloom. This Pokémon is popular with celebrities.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "No matter how much time and money is spent raising it, its flowers are the most beautiful when they bloom in the wild.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "As soon as it finds a male to be its partner, the beautiful flower on its head darkens, droops, and withers away.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fragrance of its flower differs slightly depending on the soil where it grew up. Sniffing the aroma calms your heart and mind.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s well liked by other Pokémon because of its beauty. The flower on its head needs constant care, or it will soon wither and rot.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s believed that even first-rate gardeners have a hard time getting the flower on a Lilligant’s head to bloom.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Essential oils made from Lilligant flowers have a sublime scent, but they’re also staggeringly expensive.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "I suspect that its well-developed legs are the result of a life spent on mountains covered in deep snow. The scent it exudes from its flower crown heartens those in proximity.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
